---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Thyagaraja M | Full-Stack & AI Developer</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100 text-slate-800 font-['Inter'] antialiased selection:bg-indigo-200 selection:text-indigo-900">
    
    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto p-6 md:p-12 my-8">
      
      <header class="text-center md:text-left md:flex md:justify-between md:items-center mb-16 space-y-6 md:space-y-0">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2">
            Thyagaraja M
          </h1>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500">
            Full-Stack Developer | Software Architect | 3D & AI
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:items-end text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base space-y-1">
          <span class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
            Bangalore, Karnataka, India
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
            <a href="mailto:thyagaraja1983@gmail.com" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">thyagaraja1983@gmail.com</a>
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"></path></svg>
            +91 91139 89237
          </span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="mb-16 bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-500 to-cyan-400"></div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Profile Summary</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-600 text-lg">
          Full-Stack Developer with over a decade of design experience, bridging the gap between high-end architectural visualization and scalable software architecture. Expertise in deploying robust web and mobile applications using modern stacks (React, TypeScript, Node.js) with deep integration of Generative AI, cloud deployment (GCP), and relational databases (Supabase, PostgreSQL).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-16">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
          Featured Projects
        </h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">AI Home Decorator</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-4 mt-1">Full-Stack Web & Mobile App</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              An end-to-end spatial design platform using Generative AI (Google AI Studio) for real-time interior transformations via a "Snap, Select, Decorate" workflow. Engineered prompts and API pipelines for seamless image-to-image styling.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">React</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Supabase</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">GCP</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">HDE</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-4 mt-1">SaaS Construction Estimator & Directory</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              A responsive PWA built with a logic-heavy estimation engine that calculates project costs dynamically. Features a custom SPA routing fallback and a robust Professional Directory with automated verification workflows and RBAC.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">React</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Node.js</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-green-50 text-green-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Supabase</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Wall Paint AI</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-4 mt-1">AI Visualization Platform</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              An AI-driven tool for real-time color visualization on architectural surfaces. Achieved realistic color blending using CSS masking techniques combined with AI edge detection, respecting natural room shadows and lighting.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">React</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Firebase</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
        <section>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-2 inline-block">Technical Arsenal</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Frontend & Languages</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">TypeScript</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">React</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Tailwind CSS</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">JavaScript</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">C/C++</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Backend & Cloud</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Node.js</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Supabase</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">GCP</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Firebase</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Design & Tools</h4>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Google AI Studio</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">Unreal Engine</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">3DS Max</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-md text-sm text-slate-700">AutoCAD</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-2 inline-block">Experience</h3>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-indigo-100 pl-6 space-y-8 relative">
            
            <div class="relative">
              <div class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-50"></div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3D Artist <span class="text-indigo-600 font-medium text-base ml-2">@ Eteam (Lowe's India)</span></h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Sep 2021 - Nov 2022</p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Created high-fidelity product-based images for e-commerce, driving interior, paint, and flooring automation processes.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="relative">
              <div class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 bg-indigo-300 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-50"></div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3D Designer <span class="text-indigo-600 font-medium text-base ml-2">@ Dubai Expo 2020</span></h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Aug 2019 - May 2020</p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Spearheaded concept design, 3D modeling of massive pavilions, and CAD drafting for global thematic elements.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="relative">
              <div class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 bg-slate-300 rounded-full border-4 border-slate-50"></div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3D Designer <span class="text-indigo-600 font-medium text-base ml-2">@ IMG Worlds of Adventure</span></h4>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Nov 2013 - Jun 2017</p>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Developed thematic and complex lighting design structures for large-scale entertainment and theme park projects in Dubai.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2">Education & Certifications</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
            <li>• Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) - IGNOU</li>
            <li>• Full Stack Web Development Certification (2024)</li>
            <li>• ITI Mechanical - Industrial Training Institute Bangalore</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="text-right">
          <a href="#" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors">
            Download Resume
          </a>
        </div>
      </footer>

    </main>
  </body>
</html>